        "summary": "Trigger Daily Sales Rollup",
        "description": "Idempotent daily sales rollup job. Aggregates intraday_sales into daily_sales for target_date.\nAuthorization:\n- If X-Job-Secret matches server JOB_SECRET, processes all owners.\n- Otherwise, requires valid user Bearer JWT and restricts strictly to caller's own owner_id.",
